---
import Component from "../../../src/components/donate/GiveButton.astro";
import "../../../src/styles/tokens.css";

// Isolation page for the state PRODUCTION IS ACTUALLY IN: no donation platform
// configured, so `GiveButton` renders no button at all.
//
// This is the whole feature in one frame. A blank Donate URL used to make every
// giving button open a pre-addressed inquiry email — an ask for a gift the
// organization could not yet accept, from a page quoting a campaign total
// nobody had raised. It now means giving is CLOSED: the pill is replaced by a
// plain sentence saying when the campaign opens, plus one thing a reader can do
// instead. Nothing here is shaped like an action, because nothing here can take
// a payment.
//
// Both tones are shown because the note is text rather than a pill, so unlike
// the crimson button it cannot sit on any ground: the left one is a pale band
// (the priorities list, the empty donor wall), the right one a dark band (the
// hero, the closing ask).
//
// Pasting a Givebutter URL into Page settings → Donate URL turns both of these
// back into the buttons on `GiveButton` beside it. No code change.
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Isolated: GiveButton-GivingClosed</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="codeyam-capture">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 20px; padding: 24px;">
        <span style="background: var(--momentum-cream, #f6f1e7); padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; width: 360px;">
          <Component label="Make a Gift" email="ben@harvardintech.com" campaignName="The Momentum Fund" />
        </span>
        <span style="background: #0b0b0f; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; width: 360px;">
          <Component label="Make a Gift" email="ben@harvardintech.com" campaignName="The Momentum Fund" onDark />
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
